  "meaning": "Sibling of the twelve-input direct-esse route 5e8e6054 with STMT-GRADES-HAVE-A-MAXIMUM (6c27657f, every respect) replaced by its fixed-esse instance STMT-GRADES-TO-MAXIMUM-AT-BEING (e4e6b0cd); every other premise is the same statement. The old route applies grades only at esse, inside actualCore. actualRootExists gives an actual root n from population, whole-roster nontrapping and excluded middle, without contingent dependence; the priority correspondence gives firstness; ExistingInActAt gives n esse; the existing maximumExistsOfExistingRoot at the one-point esse respect type gives a maximum in esse; maximumEqualsRoot and reducedDescription name n as God. No modal necessity is used or concluded. No premise is discharged; the old route is unchanged. Sense bridges: NECESSARY 11 to 2, NONNECESSARY 1 to 2 and WELL_FOUNDEDNESS 1 to 2 (all citing 5c898d24) are bookkeeping, not content bridges: no NecessaryAt, NonnecessaryRootAt, ContingentAt or GroundAncestor occurs in any hypothesis or step, so no passage between these senses happens. truth check requires the bridges only because 5c898d24's definition_ids link both senses of each term, which its Lean type does not use (#1524). INTRINSIC 1 to 2 (5c898d24) is carried by 5c898d24's type, which instantiates Trap's generic intrinsic parameter with the graph Source predicate, the application commitment that distinguishes ActualConcreteSupply from Supply; neither Supply constant itself occurs.",
